618:%on making decision based on the collected information without lookahead. \textcolor{red}{In the context of~\cite{gamarnik2023geometric}, this was well motivated: the best known algorithm for the discrepancy minimization constructed by Bansal and Spencer~\cite{bansalspenceronline} }
