\subsection{Main Results}
Our focus is on the $c$-restricted online algorithms, i.e., those that simultaneously satisfy Definition~\ref{def:Operation} and Condition~\eqref{eq:CondInformal}. The latter conditions asserts that at most $c\log_b^2(np)$ inspected future edges are contained in the final output generated by the algorithm.


