%Suppose that $G\sim \mathbb{G}(n,p)$ has vertex set $[n]:=\{1,\dots,n\}$, whose edge set is determined by the edge-status $e_G\bigpar{\{u,v\}} \in \{0,1\}$ for all vertex-pairs~$\{u,v\} \in \tbinom{[n]}{2}$. 
